and watched the show ♪

00:53:54.264 --> 00:53:59.269
♪ They split a lady right in two ♪

00:54:02.405 --> 00:54:05.775
♪ Which side are you on ♪

00:54:05.775 --> 00:54:09.246
♪ The dusk or the dawn ♪

00:54:09.246 --> 00:54:12.749
♪ Midnight or noon ♪

00:54:12.749 --> 00:54:16.086
♪ You're leavin' too soon ♪

00:54:16.086 --> 00:54:19.589
♪ You're leavin' too soon ♪

